 "name_en": "Sales Order Processing with Customer Down Payment (BKJ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Order Processing with Customer Down Payment (BKJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this process, you create requests for down payment, record the receipt of the down payment, and create a final invoice after the deduction of the received down payment and a receipt of the final amount due on the invoice. The process uses the billing plan functionality in Sales and Distribution. The integrated process allows the maintenance of proper document flow between the sales and financial transactions.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order and assign billing plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Remove billing block</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post down payment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute picking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document and down payment clearing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">System integrated sales order processing with customer down payment</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>含客户预付款的销售订单处理 (BKJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此流程中，创建预付款请求、记录接收预付款并在扣减收到的预付款和收到发票上最终到期金额后创建最终发票。该流程使用销售和分销中的开票计划功能。集成流程允许维护销售和财务交易之间的正确凭证流。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单并分配开票计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">移除开票冻结</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账预付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行拣配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证和预付款清算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38c8d7cad852471b82137e67946a9bcd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">系统将销售订单处理与客户预付款集成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
